<title>CHINA: China's Jan-July soyoil buying detailed.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-July soyoil buying detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows the soyoil import figures of five major Chinese customs offices as well as the country of origin during Jan-July 1996.</p>
<p>Details were provided by the General Administration of Customs of China.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes. Percentage represents the market share.</p>
<p>-----SOYOIL</p>
<p>July imports: 188,626	  Jan-July total imports:919,140</p>
<p>CUSTOMS	    July	  Pct	   Jan-July    Pct</p>
<p> Shanghai	 7,035	  3.7	   119,008    12.9</p>
<p> Qingdao	 29,500	  15.6	  122,367    13.3</p>
<p> Tianjin	 76,981	  40.8	  165,937    18.0</p>
<p> Nanjing	 29,702	  15.7	  117,583    12.8</p>
<p> Shijiazhuang  27,319	  14.5	   94,611    10.2</p>
<p>ORIGINS</p>
<p> Brazil	 186,905	  99.1	  664,110    72.2</p>
<p> Argentina	    0	   0.0	  135,203    14.7</p>
<p> US		     0	   0.0	   30,716     3.3</p>
<p> Malaysia	 1,600	   0.8	   11,400     1.2</p>
</text>
